# This directory holds the nginx Basic Auth credential file (.htpasswd) that
# gates /graphiql and / on a public deploy. It is tracked only so the bind
# mount in docker-compose.prod.yml has an existing source directory — a
# missing bind-mount source would be created by Docker as a directory, which
# nginx cannot read as a password file.
#
# The .htpasswd itself is gitignored. Generate it with:
#
#   docker run --rm httpd:2.4-alpine htpasswd -nbB demo 'YOUR_KEY' \
#     > infra/nginx/auth/.htpasswd
#
# See "Public demo access" in infra/README.md.
